    "created_at": "2020-10-12T16:19:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-12T16:19:07Z",
    "body": "The intent is to mark up all our `<dfn>`s explicitly, so that we can transition away from the fallible heuristics Shepherd uses. It looks like this was missed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5916. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5957 doesn't cover it either because the `<dfn>` is outside the IDL fragment. /cc @dontcallmedom.",
