    "body": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/w3c/webref/master/ed/dfns/html.json correctly identifies it with the proper dfn-type. and as a result #5956 would fix this I believe.\r\n\r\nAlso, once https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/issues/1761, the right dfn type will be exposed to bikeshed and respec specs independently of whether or when #5956 gets merged.\r\n",
